[en.DECISION_C11_EMERGENCY_LOVE_PLUNDER]
Emergency Love Plunder

[en.DECISION_C11_EMERGENCY_LOVE_PLUNDER_desc]
Changelings need love! And they need it now! Don’t care how you do it, take as many as you can find!

[zh.DECISION_C11_EMERGENCY_LOVE_PLUNDER]
紧急爱意掠夺

[zh.DECISION_C11_EMERGENCY_LOVE_PLUNDER_desc]
幻形灵们需要爱！而且他们现在就需要它！不关心你怎么做，能找到多少就拿多少！
